es the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n7f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"96\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Fluff Daddy</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n80:[\"$\",\"p\",\"97\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Pawdrey Plaza</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n81:[\"$\",\"p\",\"98\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Meow Zedong</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n82:[\"$\",\"p\",\"99\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Jane Pawsten</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n83:[\"$\",\"p\",\"100\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Woofgang Amadeus</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n84:[\"$\",\"p\",\"101\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Neil Armcat</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n85:[\"$\",\"p\",\"102\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Woof Blitzer</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n86:[\"$\",\"p\",\"103\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Volcano</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n87:[\"$\",\"p\",\"104\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Bark Twain</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n88:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"105\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"91–93\"]}]\n89:[\"$\",\"p\",\"106\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Hercule Poirot</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n8a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"107\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Joan Jett</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n8b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"108\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Chewbacca</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n8c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"109\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"These 200 names represent a diverse collection spanning multiple styles, origins, and inspirations. Each one has been carefully selected for quality and memorability.\"]}]\n8d:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"110\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🎯 Expert Tips & Best Practices\"]}]\n8e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"111\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>1. Keep It Short:</strong> One to two syllables is ideal. Names like Max, Luna, or Charlie are easy for pets to recognize and for you to say quickly.\"}}]\n8f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"112\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>2. Avoid Command Confusion:</strong> Don't choose names that sound like common commands. \\\"Kit\\\" sounds like \\\"sit,\\\" \\\"Bo\\\" sounds like \\\"no,\\\" and \\\"Fletch\\\" sounds like \\\"fetch.\\\" This can confuse your pet during training.\"}}]\n90:[\"$\",\"p\",\"113\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>3. Consider Longevity:</strong> A name that's cute for a kitten or puppy should still suit a full-grown cat or dog. \\\"Tiny\\\" might be adorable for a puppy but ironic for a 100-pound adult dog.\"}}]\n91:[\"$\",\"p\",\"114\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>4. Test the \\\"Backdoor Test\\\":</strong> Stand at your back door and call the name loudly three times. If you feel embarrassed, keep looking. You'll be doing this regularly!\"}}]\n92:[\"$\",\"p\",\"115\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>5. Use Positive Association:</strong> Always pair the name with positive experiences — treats, pets, play. Never use your pet's name when scolding them.\"}}]\n93:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"116\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"⚠️ Common Mistakes to Avoid\"]}]\n94:[\"$\",\"p\",\"117\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Rushing the Decision:</strong> Take your time. Most new pet owners feel pressure to name their pet immediately, but waiting a few days to understand their personality leads to better choices.\"}}]\n95:[\"$\",\"p\",\"118\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Choosing Names Too Similar to Family Members:</strong> A pet named \\\"Molly\\\" when your daughter's friend is also Molly can create awkward situations. Check that the name doesn't overlap with people in your immediate circle.\"}}]\n96:[\"$\",\"p\",\"119\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Names That Are Hard to Spell or Pronounce:</strong> You'll need to spell your pet's name for vet records, microchip registration, and insurance. X Æ A-12 might be a famous baby name, but it's impractical for daily pet life.\"}}]\n97:[\"$\",\"p\",\"120\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Ignoring Breed Heritage:</strong> A Scottish Terrier named \\\"Haggis\\\" or a Shiba Inu named \\\"Mochi\\\" connects your pet to its breed heritage. Consider names that honor your pet's origins.\"}}]\n98:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"121\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🔗 Explore More Name Ideas\"]}]\n99:[\"$\",\"p\",\"122\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Looking for more inspiration? Browse our complete collection of name generators: \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"81\",{\"href\":\"/animal/glass-frog/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Glass Frog\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"101\",{\"href\":\"/animal/basilisk/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Basilisk\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"119\",{\"href\":\"/animal/bush-dog/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Bush Dog\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"137\",{\"href\":\"/animal/greater-flamingo/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Greater Flamingo\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"167\",{\"href\":\"/animal/laperm/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"LaPerm\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names. Each generator features 160+ hand-picked names across 9 unique categories including male, female, cute, funny, fantasy, unique, cool, and baby names.\"]}]\n9a:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What are the best names for parrots?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Parrots suit colorful, tropical names like Rio, Mango, Kiwi, Coco, and Skittles. They're intelligent and talkative, so names that are fun to say work best. Famous parrot names include Iago (Aladdin) and Paulie.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"How do I name a pair of lovebirds?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Lovebird pairs deserve romantic or complementary names: Romeo & Juliet, Peanut & Butter, Salt & Pepper, Bonnie & Clyde, or Sonny & Cher. The names should feel like a matched set that celebrates their bond.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What are good cockatiel names?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Cockatiels suit cheerful, musical names: Sunny, Chirpy, Melody, Whistler, Maestro, Ziggy, and Pikachu are all popular choices. Their crest and orange cheeks inspire names like Blush, Spike, or Firecrest.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should I name my canary after its song?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Canaries are famous for singing, so music-themed names are perfect: Mozart, Beethoven, Aria, Sonata, Cadenza, or Diva. Color-based names like Sunny or Goldie also work beautifully for these bright yellow birds.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n9b:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"parrot\",{\"href\":\"/animal/parrot/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦜\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Parrot\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"cockatiel\",{\"href\":\"/animal/cockatiel/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦜\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Cockatiel\"}]]}],null,[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"canary\",{\"href\":\"/animal/canary/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐦\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover