os, finches, and more.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/manifest.json\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"bird-names\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"p:domain_verify\",\"content\":\"acc18c9aa2855ead49c874b6cac9cb61\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"6\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/best-bird-names-by-species/\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"200 Best Bird Names Organized by Species 🦜\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Complete guide to bird names for parrots, cockatoos, finches, and more.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"article\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"200 Best Bird Names Organized by Species 🦜\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Complete guide to bird names for parrots, cockatoos, finches, and more.\"}]]\n","/blog/$d$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n9:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\"],\"\"]\n87:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n88:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n2:T3b85,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BlogPosting\",\"headline\":\"200 Best Bird Names Organized by Species 🦜\",\"description\":\"Complete guide to bird names for parrots, cockatoos, finches, and more.\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-04\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-06\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/about/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/best-bird-names-by-species/\"},\"wordCount\":2254,\"articleBody\":\"📋 Table of Contents  🐾 Introduction Complete guide to bird names for parrots, cockatoos, finches, and more. Whether you're naming a new pet, a character in your story, or just exploring for fun, you've come to the right place. At Animal Name Generator, we've curated thousands of name ideas across hundreds of animal species to help you find that perfect match. Our database spans {caracal}, {crab-eating-macaque}, {ocellaris-clownfish}, {highlander}, {gordon-setter}, {fire-bellied-toad}, and many more — each with 160+ hand-picked names. This guide focuses on bringing you the best of the best in one convenient place. 📛 The Complete List — 200 Best Bird Names Organized by Species 🦜 1–10 <strong>Catzilla</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible. <strong>Sir Barksalot</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm. <strong>David Hasselhop</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day. <strong>Chairman Meow</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible. <strong>Droolius Caesar</strong> — A clever twist that suits a smart and mischievous companion who always keeps you laughing. <strong>Pablo Escobark</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes. <strong>Mutt Damon</strong> — Inspired by pop culture, this name works great for pets that have a dramatic flair or star quality. <strong>Princess Leia Organa</strong> — A clever twist that suits a smart and mischievous companion who always keeps you laughing. <strong>Avalanche</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm. <strong>Woofy Goldberg</strong> — With a name